<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Java on Băng Trinh - Developer</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/tags/java/</link><description>Recent content in Java on Băng Trinh - Developer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:20:00 +0700</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/tags/java/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Java Exception Handling Tips</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-exception-handling-tips/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:20:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-exception-handling-tips/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Xử lý exception giúp code ổn định và dễ debug.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="ví-dụ"&gt;Ví dụ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;try&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; result &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; 10 &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt; 0;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;} &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;catch&lt;/span&gt;(ArithmeticException e) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; System.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Cannot divide by zero!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;} &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;finally&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; System.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Always executed&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="mẹo"&gt;Mẹo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sử dụng &lt;code&gt;try-with-resources&lt;/code&gt; cho AutoCloseable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Không catch generic &lt;code&gt;Exception&lt;/code&gt; trừ khi thật sự cần.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Quản lý exception tốt giúp ứng dụng chạy ổn định và dễ bảo trì.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Functional Programming in Java</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/functional-programming-in-java/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:00:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/functional-programming-in-java/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Java 8 trở đi hỗ trợ lập trình functional với lambda và streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="ví-dụ"&gt;Ví dụ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;List&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;Integer&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; numbers &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; Arrays.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;asList&lt;/span&gt;(1, 2, 3, 4);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;numbers.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;stream&lt;/span&gt;()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; .&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;(n &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; n &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; n)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; .&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;forEach&lt;/span&gt;(System.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;::println);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="mẹo"&gt;Mẹo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;map&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;filter&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;reduce&lt;/code&gt; là những function quan trọng.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Giúp code gọn, dễ test và maintain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Functional programming trong Java giúp code modular và readable.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Java 17 Features You Must Know</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-17-features-you-must-know/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:40:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-17-features-you-must-know/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Java 17 mang đến nhiều cải tiến hữu ích.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="nổi-bật"&gt;Nổi bật&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sealed Classes&lt;/strong&gt;: Giới hạn class con.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Records&lt;/strong&gt;: Data class ngắn gọn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pattern Matching for switch&lt;/strong&gt;: Dễ đọc hơn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;record&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Point&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; x, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; y) {}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Point p &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; Point(1, 2);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;System.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;(p.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;());
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Cập nhật lên Java 17 để tận dụng các tính năng hiện đại và tối ưu code.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Java Generics Explained</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-generics-explained/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:20:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-generics-explained/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Generics giúp code Java an toàn kiểu dữ liệu và dễ bảo trì.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="vì-sao-cần-sử-dụng-generics"&gt;Vì sao cần sử dụng Generics?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;List&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;String&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; names &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; ArrayList&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;names.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Alice&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// names.add(10); // Lỗi biên dịch!&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="mẹo"&gt;Mẹo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sử dụng &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; cho class hoặc method.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Giúp tránh casting thủ công.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Generics tăng type-safety nhưng không thể sử dụng với primitive types trực tiếp.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Java Streams Made Easy</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-streams-made-easy/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:00:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-streams-made-easy/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Java Streams giúp bạn thao tác trên collections một cách dễ dàng và hiệu quả.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="stream-basics"&gt;Stream Basics&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bạn có thể tạo Stream từ List, Set, hoặc Arrays:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;List&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;String&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; names &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; Arrays.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;asList&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Alice&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Bob&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Charlie&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;names.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;stream&lt;/span&gt;()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; .&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;filter&lt;/span&gt;(name &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; name.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;startsWith&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;A&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;))
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; .&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;forEach&lt;/span&gt;(System.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;::println);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="mẹo"&gt;Mẹo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;map()&lt;/code&gt; để biến đổi dữ liệu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;filter()&lt;/code&gt; để lọc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;collect()&lt;/code&gt; để gom kết quả lại.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Streams giúp viết code ngắn gọn, nhưng hãy nhớ lazy evaluation và tránh side-effect.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>